pen and there's only one. It describes the failure, the stalled first attempt and the current state. It also lists two follow-ups: find why v2.3.1 failed, and why the orchestrator stopped the rollout.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0142ArboFE32gZVESFaKd5Dc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01EyhF3yQt4TTFFmX7YvLC8C", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The latest healthy release is v2.3.0 (seq 1). Both later releases, v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1, are unhealthy. Rolling back now.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01F15XkNGfus5zEoJV3QCiji", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01VLVYbbVCWTvGq4h5fhFDK2", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback only finished in us-east. Rolling back to the same version again is safe, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01TzxBuRphfuYgz7Q2We5AiD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01GyZsFafFAjLUbGTL4AEast", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "to