t finished in us-east, us-west and eu-west.\n- **Result:** the service passes health checks and the error rate dropped from 18% to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** the request to create INC-0001 timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and it had been created, so it's open and there's only one. It describes the failure, the stalled first attempt and the current state. It also lists two follow-ups: find why v2.3.1 failed, and why the orchestrator stopped the rollout.", "type": "text"}]}]}